WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.165 --> 00:00:05.650
Okay, so AI crawlers in robots.txt aren't one bot,

2
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:10.222
because OpenAI and Anthropic each run a separate agent for each job.

3
00:00:10.222 --> 00:00:13.207
GPTBot and ClaudeBot collect training data,

4
00:00:13.207 --> 00:00:17.312
while OAI-SearchBot and Claude-SearchBot index my docs for search.

5
00:00:17.312 --> 00:00:21.267
So I can block GPTBot and still show up in ChatGPT search,

6
00:00:21.347 --> 00:00:24.947
because OpenAI says each setting is independent.

7
00:00:25.227 --> 00:00:28.747
But a crawler obeys only the group that names it,

8
00:00:28.747 --> 00:00:34.487
so a GPTBot group for drafts drops the wildcard rule that kept it out of admin.

9
00:00:34.555 --> 00:00:35.680
So for docs,

10
00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:39.610
I'd leave every search agent open and decide on training separately,

11
00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:40.620
in its own group.
